<title>NETHERLANDS: Cobepa unit takes stake in label producer.</title>
<headline>Cobepa unit takes stake in label producer.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Parisbas Deelnemingen N.V., a Dutch subsidiary of Belgian investment firm Cobepa, has taken a 25 percent stake in Rotterdam-based label producer Sens Label, Cobepa said on Monday.</p>
<p>Sens Label had a turnover of 61 million guilders in 1995, making it the fourth biggest player on its field in Europe, Cobepa said.</p>
<p>Other major shareholders of Sens Label are Sauerbier Beheer N.V. (40 pct) and the Dutch venture capital company Nederlandse Participatie Maatschappij N.V. (35 pct).</p>
<p>No financial details of the deal were given.</p>
